OL,3,GNEWSAFirms fined over #1m after workman
OL,4,A'buried alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo businesses have been fined more
OL,7,Fthan #1m over the "horrifying" death of
OL,8,Fa labourer who was buried alive.
OL,10,FGheorghita Arsene, 33, was fatally
OL,11,Fcrushed when a deep trench collapsed
OL,12,Fand covered him in soil while working
OL,13,Fon a construction site in Banstead,
OL,14,FSurrey, in June 2020.
OL,16,FAppledorn Developments and T Vaughan
OL,17,FLimited (TVL) were found guilty of a
OL,18,Fcharge under the Health and Safety at
OL,19,FWork Act 1974 following a three-month
OL,20,Ftrial at the Old Bailey.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
